  topic: 'd-limonene: omit only the source-rejected malformed CAS row'
  outcome: supported
  summary: Support RETIRE_INVALID_CAS for the complete historical cas:138-86-7 row
    only. The current verified owner has explicitly rejected that active identity,
    while preserving MIM:0000862 and its genuine legacy slug.
  details: 'The raw source distinguishes d-limonene from its separate D,L entry. ChEBI:15382
    defines the R form and links the d name to CAS 5989-27-5. The two-star duplicate
    has matching stereochemical InChI but mixed synonym baggage; I do not treat its
    DL labels as interchangeable. A failed check digit diagnoses the old assertion
    but cannot select the R replacement. The actual owner afterimage, rejected alias,
    unchanged original curation-history prefix and endpoint-bound source reviews corroborate
    that this is an applied source correction, not a pending proposal. Limits: No
    positive decision on newly generated mapping rows, original source bindings, roles,
